{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nWe walked four hours in Antwerp this morning with Mr. van Ghert. The churches are packed with life-size marble statues, and one nave held two dozen large paintings by Rubens and van Dyck. I confess the sheer volume was dizzying; I felt less like a student of history and more like a man drowning in oil paint. Van Ghert returned to Brussels to check for your letters and send them to Amsterdam. I hope they are safe.\n\nI am tired, but the air is fine. I do not know what to write about the food, but the wine was decent. I miss your company and the quiet of our rooms in Berlin. The Dutch are polite, but they lack a certain spark. I shall wait for word. Give my love to the boys.\n\nYour husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795218858,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens":1120,"total_tokens":1294,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-SJHjwktt3YxW7xo1xf6uxYjbaO4TF6vc","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1120,"prompt_ms":1118.026,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9982375000000001,"prompt_per_second":1001.7656118909576,"predicted_n":174,"predicted_ms":4130.092,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.873364161849707,"predicted_per_second":41.887686763394136}}